WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:23.460
A SHOWDOWN DEMANDED BY HATE

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:26.830
"A Showdown Demanded By Hate".

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:36.630
Prep all landed mobile suits for atmospheric combat!

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:39.000
Make sure to recheck the energy packs!

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:42.630
Resupplying V2's armor and weaponry takes priority!

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:45.360
No, you idiot, not just because the brass ordered it!

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:48.060
It's the mobile suit that infiltrated Angel Halo!

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:49.800
They're sending it out again!

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:51.430
Dad.

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:53.830
Shahkti's returned, as well?

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:57.630
Yes, but I'm going back to Angel Halo.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.760
I was told about that.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:02.130
If you get close to Angel Halo again,

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:04.830
destroy that place they call the key room.

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:08.200
But Shahkti wants to go back into the key room...

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:10.600
...to save the twenty thousand psychickers in the rings.

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:13.430
Twenty thousand lives or the fate of mankind?

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:15.330
Which is more important?

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:18.960
If we can free the psychickers, Angel Halo will shut down.

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:24.530
Shahkti, your head doesn't hurt, does it?

00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:26.200
The air's thin.

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:30.100
I'm okay. Let me be clear. I'll stop Angel Halo.

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:33.860
Leave the Sugan Fleet and the Motorad Fleet to us.

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:35.560
We'll be counting on you.

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:37.560
V2 and the Reineforce Junior...

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:40.600
...are to bring down Angel Halo. All clear?

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:41.700
Roger.

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:44.530
Go relax in the gun room while your weapons are swapped out.

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:46.860
Shahkti, you will guide Üso...

00:02:46.900 --> 00:02:50.030
...and help him to complete his mission safely.

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.000
Yes, sir.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:59.600
He wants me dead.

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:02.500
He thinks I'm the real enemy!

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:18.060
I'll have the V2 sortie directly from the Jeanne d'Arc.

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:19.300
Well done.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:23.430
Now, all ships, let's break the back of the Sugan Fleet ahead of us.

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:31.360
The Earth is right in front of us, and unless you want all life on it...

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:34.100
...to revert back to what it was three billion years ago,

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:36.230
smash the enemy that's overhead!

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:38.900
Why three billion years ago?

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:41.900
Life arose three and a half billion years ago.

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:44.700
It'd be even worse going back any further than that.

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:46.130
Exactly!

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:50.360
Once the V2 Assault leaves the Jeanne d'Arc, the Shrike Team will launch!

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:55.930
After all we've been through, do whatever it takes to bring down Angel Halo, Üso!

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:59.000
Roger, Reineforce Jinn Jahannam!

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:00.900
V2 Assault, here I go!

00:04:00.930 --> 00:04:02.260
Go to it, Üso.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:04.360
Yes, sir. Ready, Shahkti?

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:05.400
Go ahead.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:12.760
Here comes Üso. Karel, once we launch, fall back to the rear and stand by!

00:04:12.860 --> 00:04:14.200
Roger that!

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:21.530
What? The Shrike Team's standing by?

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:23.430
Aren't they in the vanguard?

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:29.530
It's starting, Tomáš. I'm heading in!

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:32.460
No! We fortify the rear by staying on the midline!

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:33.700
But...

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:45.800
The Shrike Team's catching up with us.

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:49.100
Yeah. They know this is a job for everyone.

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:06.600
The League Militaire have entered firing range?

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:09.060
Yes, but still outside battle range 1-

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:10.060
Opinion, sir?

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:14.200
Angel Halo is using the psychickers as batteries,

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:17.760
and still emitting the prayers of Queen Maria and the princess.

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:20.930
It's demonstrating greater power than predicted.

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:25.760
Which means we need to buy more time for Angel Halo.

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:29.300
Even so, our offenses are weakened, aren't they?

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:33.730
Cronicle's Adrastea Fleet especially doesn't seem to be moving.

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:35.530
I've demanded that they do so.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:38.130
They say that Cronicle himself is going out.

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:41.830
Üso!

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:42.760
I know!

00:05:48.100 --> 00:05:50.030
Damn! That diffused it!

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:51.300
The wings of light!

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:59.700
Is there a powerful enemy ahead of V2?!

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:02.600
Of course there is! These guys are desperate!

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:04.700
The enemy defense is fortifying!

00:06:04.730 --> 00:06:07.360
If we can breach this bulwark, we can do something about it!

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:08.900
Our fleet!

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:18.200
All turrets, set up a barrage and deploy shields!

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:20.300
Shouldn't we jettison the damaged engine?

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:23.660
No. We're going to open a hole in the enemy's defenses...

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:25.600
...by turning it into a weapon!

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:27.100
Into a weapon?!

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:30.460
Have all new recruits and first-year soldiers abandon ship.

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:32.560
We're going to ram them!

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:34.260
Ram them?!

00:06:39.730 --> 00:06:42.060
The Jeanne d'Arc is accelerating!

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:43.430
He's gonna ram them!

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:45.030
Mubarac is...

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:52.800
Don't you want to help those kids any way you can, Jinn Jahannam?

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:58.560
He's as clever as the rumors said.

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.800
I wonder what he'll do next.

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:08.160
Why is that ship charging ahead?

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:11.430
It's trying to cut into us, just like that white monster!

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:18.160
Let's see if we can't take two or three more ships down!

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:21.330
How's the evac of the young crew members going?!

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:22.330
Smoothly, sir!

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:24.560
Intensify anti-mobile suit defenses!

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:29.930
As if I'd let you ram us!

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:32.330
Now to take down the Reineforce!

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:39.000
If we don't hurry, people are just going to die!

00:07:39.030 --> 00:07:40.600
Üso! Hurry!

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:42.230
I am hurrying!

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:53.730
Üso, the Jeanne d'Arc's signal is gone!

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:55.030
Üso!

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:57.000
What?! I can't hear you!

00:07:57.030 --> 00:07:58.860
The Jeanne d'Arc has been destroyed!

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:00.200
Destroyed?

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:16.530
The Jeanne d'Arc has been destroyed...

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:19.300
Üso... He's crying?

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:23.500
I'm worried about the Reineforce. Marbet, could you go back and assist?

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:24.630
But...

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:26.630
We'll support Üso!

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:28.730
We owe him that much.

00:08:28.930 --> 00:08:31.000
Just admit you like him.

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:33.860
This is about a girl's duty to her fellow pilot!

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:36.160
I'll get past those tire suits!

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:41.430
The Shrike Team's going on ahead! Please, don't go in too deep!

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.930
H-He's slipped in from below us!

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:54.860
Üso, we've got this!

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.160
Our defense line is fragmenting!

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:02.200
Sugan! Has the Adrastea been destroyed?

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:04.230
We still can't confirm that it has.

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:06.130
At the very least, Cronicle himself...

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:08.960
...and a woman named Katejina appear to have sortied.

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:13.260
He was lured into a mobile suit by a woman?

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:17.130
That foolish, immature...

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:22.360
Order the imperial guard to shoot down the enemy before dealing with the rings!

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:30.160
How long do we hide here?

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:31.830
For as long as it takes.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:35.030
We guard this spot till the kid comes back out!

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:54.860
He left me in control of V2! What do I do? I am nervous!

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:56.930
Üso, you should go to your father.

00:09:56.960 --> 00:10:00.160
The man on the Jeanne d'Arc was Jinn Jahannam.

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:04.100
He's a stranger I don't know. That's how I'll think of him, now.

00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:05.060
Üso!

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:09.530
Princess!

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:11.430
Who's this pilot?

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:12.630
I'm going in to pray.

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:14.860
Y-Yes, but...

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:18.300
Outside, thousands of people are killing each other.

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:19.000
Y-Yes.

00:10:19.030 --> 00:10:22.560
On top of that, if the twenty-thousand psychickers die,

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.760
Angel Halo will be rendered meaningless.

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:26.500
As you say.

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:31.200
This boy understands that, and brought me back here.

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:33.230
I wish to save the psychickers,

00:10:33.260 --> 00:10:35.960
demonstrate Angel Halo's hidden power,

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.160
and end this battle.

00:10:38.760 --> 00:10:41.060
Angel Halo's hidden power?

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:42.130
Yes.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:47.160
Let's realize everything its designers wished for it to do.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:51.160
Do as the princess says! Fully activate Angel Halo!

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:52.300
Levels, rising!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.960
There are five damaged sections, but...

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:57.400
You who have obeyed me...

00:10:57.430 --> 00:11:00.630
...and prayed yourselves to exhaustion.

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:02.960
Let us make a peace which is essentially...

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:06.360
...to have the souls of the many return to their families.

00:11:06.530 --> 00:11:10.960
Fathers, mothers, and all those who love one another...

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:13.930
Let us make a world where they can all be together.

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:38.460
What is this light?

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:46.130
On the other side of the stars, hoshi no mukou ni

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:47.700
What?

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:49.200
there lies the future mirai ga aru to
The rings are glowing!

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:52.530
What's this trembling?
there lies the future mirai ga aru to

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:56.360
The young ones... wakamonotachi wa

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:58.700
It's like I can hear singing.

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:01.330
...spread their wings of dreams yume no tsubasa wo hirogete
What is this?

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:04.200
You hear the singing too, right, Karl?

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:06.000
...spread their wings of dreams yume no tsubasa wo hirogete

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:08.730
As they scatter the red poppy blossoms hinageshi no hana wo chirashi nagara
Hearing a song on the battlefield!

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:10.700
Don't be absurd!

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:12.560
As they scatter the red poppy blossoms hinageshi no hana wo chirashi nagara

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:14.800
Be silent, Kagatie's ring!

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:17.960
As they scatter the red poppy blossoms hinageshi no hana wo chirashi nagara

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.800
