Was it the Reineforce?

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:23.660
Setting out on their journey tabidatte iku

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:25.700
A BESPA mobile suit's firing on it.

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:25.730
Setting out on their journey tabidatte iku

00:12:25.730 --> 00:12:26.960
Okay, then!

