00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.360
Frannie, what are you doing?

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:31.160
Hey, you! You want to use that cannon for our side?

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:33.600
What?!

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:38.360
As they scatter the red poppy blossoms hinageshi no hana wo chirashi nagara
You thought you could frolic...

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:40.560
