As they scatter the red poppy blossoms hinageshi no hana wo chirashi nagara

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:44.330
Too slow!

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:49.360
As they scatter the red poppy blossoms hinageshi no hana wo chirashi nagara

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:53.430
