Dammit, the singing's getting stronger!

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:55.860
It feels like it's gouging out my heart!

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:55.900
Setting out on their journey tabidatte iku

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:59.530
I see! You're doing this!

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:01.730
Setting out on their journey tabidatte iku

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:07.830
Everywhere I go, you just make a fool of me!

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:09.530
Miss Katejina.

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:13.300
This isn't where you wish to return to.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.030
Üso!

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:18.400
Enemy! Enemy! Must shoot!

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:21.160
Haro! Don't shoot her!

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:22.560
Miss Katejina!

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:27.130
You don't really believe what Kagatie's doing is justified, do you?!

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:29.060
I do, little boy.

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:32.860
What's more, I found a place for myself with Cronicle.

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:35.060
But you and Shahkti...

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:37.830
You laughed at that! You're just children, but...

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:41.330
How could Miss Katejina Loos of Uwig misunderstand us like this?!

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:44.700
Cronicle was kind to me! That's why...

00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:48.300
Then why not just leave a kid like me alone?!

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:50.460
Üso!

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:52.830
What?!

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:58.230
V2!

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:02.760
Cronicle, come!

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:09.930
That mobile suit's after the Reineforce again!

00:14:15.260 --> 00:14:17.330
He managed to get below the Reineforce?!

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:20.130
What?!

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:23.460
Farewell, Reineforce!

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:25.100
Cronicle, come!

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:26.900
What? Katejina?

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:28.730
No, you don't!

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:35.130
Seal the portside engine!

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:39.960
You're not shooting down our ship!

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:42.400
Odelo, pull back so I can shoot him!

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:47.500
Another one?

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.360
V1! Miss Marbet!

00:14:53.230 --> 00:14:54.330
Where's the other one?!

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:56.930
I don't intend to die with you!

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:04.060
All blocks, damage report!

00:15:04.260 --> 00:15:06.060
Seal all valves and lock them!

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:09.800
Have them jettison the engine, Captain!

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:11.000
Right!

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:15.330
Maybe it's time to make peace with ourselves, Captain.

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:18.130
If that's what His Excellency Jinn Jahannam thinks...

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:21.660
Then perhaps we should have the young people abandon ship.

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:24.860
Right! Ness, alert all hands to prepare to abandon ship!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:26.900
Prepare to abandon ship?!

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:29.430
The Reineforce can still do a job.

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:32.560
We old men want you to leave this to us.

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:34.030
Mr. Leonid!

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:35.930
Striker, abandon ship, too!

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:36.700
But...

00:15:36.730 --> 00:15:39.500
We'll use whatever mobile suits you have left!

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:41.760
Why? The Reineforce can still...

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:42.730
She'll fight.

