Let everyone hear.

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:24.760
The power that dwells in the Earth has begun to envelop us.

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:27.530
The spirits of the land...

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:30.400
...are joining with our prayers which overflow from this ring,

00:18:30.430 --> 00:18:32.930
growing into something even stronger.

00:18:33.160 --> 00:18:35.060
And so, let us send this strength...

00:18:35.100 --> 00:18:38.260
