00:18:50.030 --> 00:18:52.800
Cronicle's late! Where is he?!

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:57.660
What? My fleet's been destroyed?!

00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:02.800
The one surviving League Militaire ship wiped out the Motorad Fleet?!

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:06.700
Damn you, Cronicle! How do you intend to make up for this?!

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:14.460
Light? What is this light?

00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:16.860
It's falling from Angel Halo?

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:19.560
My suit's temperature isn't rising, but...

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:21.860
Does that mean this isn't physical energy?

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:23.330
It's pretty, but...

00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:26.400
You don't think this is a new weapon too, do you?

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:28.800
Does it feel good, Karl?

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:31.200
It's falling from Angel Halo.

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:36.700
It's warm light! But, what is it? These warm vibrations!

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:40.200
The project shouldn't be causing an effect like this!

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:55.030
Angel Halo is falling apart!

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:58.900
Not exactly. Shahkti and the psychickers are doing it.

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:03.000
I sense him...

00:20:03.030 --> 00:20:08.030
Beware! A deep hatred wrapped in kindness is after you, Üso.

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:10.300
I've found him!

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:14.600
The boy who follows Katejina around and blocks my every move!

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:15.960
Die!

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:30.100
You changed Miss Katejina!

00:20:30.130 --> 00:20:33.560
She wanted to change! Children should mind their own business!

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:37.500
The kindness within each has made them enemies of each other.

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:40.600
Please know that life is harsh.

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:42.700
Even Miss Cony...

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:46.000
Üso, I'll help!

00:20:46.030 --> 00:20:50.230
I'm the last member of the Shrike Team left to protect you!

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:53.760
You won't escape!

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:56.800
What?!

00:21:03.000 --> 00:21:05.630
You... A woman?!

00:21:06.730 --> 00:21:07.760
You mustn't.

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:12.260
No one must interfere with Cronicle and Üso's battle.

00:21:12.530 --> 00:21:15.300
I hear a voice! A woman's voice...

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:17.130
This battle...

00:21:17.260 --> 00:21:21.160
...has two men fighting for me as the prize.

00:21:21.530 --> 00:21:23.700
That's why I won't let you interfere!

00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:31.130
Be they BESPA or League Militaire,

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:34.930
I can't let anyone interfere with these men I hold in the palm of my hand!

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:46.800
Üso Ewin!

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.300
Cronicle Asher!

00:21:51.860 --> 00:21:54.900
Fight, Cronicle! Üso!

00:21:54.930 --> 00:21:57.360
Fight in the palm of my hand!

00:21:57.400 --> 00:22:02.100
And whoever wins, I shall love with all my soul!

00:23:31.300 --> 00:23:34.130
Above the disintegrating Angel Halo,

00:23:34.160 --> 00:23:37.060
hatred collides with righteousness.

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:42.500
Can a prayer for peace make an angel's halo take flight?

00:23:43.430 --> 00:23:45.900
Can it make souls ascending to heaven...

00:23:45.930 --> 00:23:48.760
...spread wings of light?

